# Build and Deployment Workflow Rules

## Build System Requirements
- **ALWAYS use build script**: `/mnt/wsl/SDK/build_autonomy_daemon.sh`
- **NEVER run make commands manually** - causes caching issues
- Build script handles proper cache cleaning and SDK toolchain usage
- Wait for build completion before analyzing results

## Deployment Process
- **ALWAYS use deploy script**: `/mnt/wsl/SDK/deploy_autonomy_daemon.sh`
- Deploy to RUTOS router at 192.168.80.1
- Use SSH key: `~/.ssh/rutos_key`
- Verify deployment with version check before testing

## SDK Integration
- **SDK Location**: `/mnt/wsl/SDK/rutos-ipq40xx-rutx-sdk`
- **Source Code**: `/mnt/s/autonomy/src/c/autonomy-daemon`
- **Target Device**: RUTOS router at 192.168.80.1
- **SSH Key**: `~/.ssh/rutos_key`

## Cache Management
- **CRITICAL**: Always clean caches after source code changes
- Build script automatically performs thorough cache cleaning
- Remove build directories, staging stamps, and package info
- Clean object files (*.o) and dependency files (*.d)

## Package Dependencies
- **Required libraries**: libubus, libblobmsg_json, libubox, libjson-c, libcjson, libuci, libcurl, libm, libpthread, libsqlite3, libcrypto, libssl, libdl
- **cJSON bundling**: Bundle cJSON library directly in package (remove from DEPENDS)
- **Library location**: `/usr/local/usr/lib/` in package
- **Binary location**: `/usr/local/usr/bin/autonomy-daemon`

## Deployment Workflow
1. **Build with build script**: `/mnt/wsl/SDK/build_autonomy_daemon.sh`
2. **Check build status**: `/mnt/wsl/SDK/check_build_status.sh` wait 30sec to run again if build is in progress until build is done. Max runtime allowed for build is 10 minutes, check statusmessage for elapsed time. 
3. **Deploy with deploy script**: `/mnt/wsl/SDK/deploy_autonomy_daemon.sh`
4. **Verify version**: Check daemon reports correct version
5. **5-minute runtime test**: Run comprehensive test for stability

## Error Detection and Fixes
- **Use compilation error detector**: `/mnt/wsl/SDK/compilation_error_detector.sh`
- **Systematic error search**: Find same error pattern across entire codebase
- **Automated fixes**: LOGX macros, format specifiers, missing includes, Unicode removal 
- **Manual review required**: When feature degredation is required 

## Version Synchronization
- **Update VERSION file**: Increment build number
- **Update version.h**: Update build number and version string
- **Update ubus_methods.c**: Update hardcoded version strings
- **Verify deployment**: Check daemon reports correct version

## Testing Commands
- **Quick version check**: `ssh -i ~/.ssh/rutos_key root@192.168.80.1 "LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/usr/local/usr/lib:/usr/lib timeout 10 /usr/local/usr/bin/autonomy-daemon --version"`
- **Full 5-minute test**: `ssh -i ~/.ssh/rutos_key root@192.168.80.1 "LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/usr/local/usr/lib:/usr/lib timeout 300 /usr/local/usr/bin/autonomy-daemon --foreground"`
- **Log analysis**: Check for segmentation faults, errors, warnings, failed initializations, conflicts, interoperability, missing functions, missing data, loops 

## Success Criteria
- ✅ **Version Verification**: Daemon reports correct version number
- ✅ **Clean Startup**: No segmentation faults during initialization
- ✅ **All Modules Initialize**: UCI, UBUS, ML monitoring, Starlink tracking all start successfully
- ✅ **5+ Minute Runtime**: Daemon runs continuously for 5+ minutes without crashes or freezing 
- ✅ **No Error Messages**: No ERROR or WARNING messages in logs
- ✅ **All UBUS Methods Registered**: All expected UBUS methods are available and providing expected real data (no mock or hardcoded data)
- ✅ **Starlink gRPC Communication**: Internal gRPC implementation works without external binaries
